ed on the findings.\n</think>\n\nget_dependency_graph  \nTo understand the interactions and dependencies between the identified services (cart, flagd, frontend-proxy), I need to visualize their communication patterns. The `get_dependency_graph` tool will reveal how these services are interconnected, helping identify potential bottlenecks, missing dependencies, or abnormal traffic patterns that could indicate faults. This provides a foundational view of the system\'s architecture and relationships.  \n\n<tool_call>\n{"name": "get_dependency_graph", "arguments": {"last_n_minutes": 10}}\n</tool_call>', additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': Usage(completion_tokens=488, prompt_tokens=1672, total_tokens=2160, completion_tokens_details=None, prompt_tokens_details=None), 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfbd9-afdc-7373-8468-153b9a39f482-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1672, 'output_tokens': 488, 'total_tokens': 2160}), HumanMessage(content='Now generate a tool call according to your last chosen tool.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='a90c7795-e018-4ee6-8485-707ec3416849')]]
