ss issues is the absence of a readiness probe in the `product-catalog` deployment. This causes Kubernetes to incorrectly mark the pod as \'Ready\' without verifying the application is operational, leading to connection failures and timeouts. The `ad` and `cart` services may also have similar misconfigurations, but `product-catalog` is the most direct culprit."}', additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': Usage(completion_tokens=588, prompt_tokens=17744, total_tokens=18332, completion_tokens_details=None, prompt_tokens_details=None), 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfbde-3555-7fb0-99bc-319ea9db5ad2-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 17744, 'output_tokens': 588, 'total_tokens': 18332}), HumanMessage(content='Now generate a tool call according to your last chosen tool.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='ea406195-0774-4889-85e5-6103d5366300')]]
